Package: fred
Title: API Wrapper to the FRED and ALFRED Federal Reserve Economic Data API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
URL: https://dereckscompany.github.io/fred,
    https://github.com/dereckscompany/fred
BugReports: https://github.com/dereckscompany/fred/issues
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Dereck",
           family = "Mezquita",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "dereck@mezquita.io",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9307-6762"))
Description: R API wrapper to the St. Louis Fed's FRED and ALFRED economic-data API supporting both synchronous and asynchronous (promise based) operations. Provides an R6 client for series observations, as-known-then ALFRED vintages (paged for large matrices), series metadata, search, and releases, built on the shared connectcore transport base with a vintage-first, point-in-time-honest discipline.
